              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "химчистка (khimchístka) — \"a dry cleaner's; dry cleaning\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Мы отдали пальто в химчистку. My otdáli paltó v khimchístku. We took the coat to the dry cleaner's."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "Feminine; short for химическая чистка — chemical cleaning."
            }
          ]
        },
