          "title": "The word, taken apart",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "химчистка (khimchístka) is a short form of химическая чистка 'chemical cleaning', from химия 'chemistry' and чистка 'cleaning', on чистый 'clean', which is inherited from Proto-Slavic čistŭ (EtymDB)."
